# =============================================================================
# Data (Large files)
# =============================================================================
# NOTE: data/ (CFD CSV ground truth, ~1.4 GB) is tracked ON PURPOSE so a plain
# `git clone` brings everything needed to retrain on the HPC. If the clone is
# too large for your remote, untrack it (`git rm -r --cached data`) and copy it
# over with rsync/scp instead.
#

